@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor #202124
skinparam defaultFontColor #F0F0F0
skinparam ArrowColor #AAAAAA
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #303238
  BorderColor #70747B
  RoundCorner 14
}
title 阶段 10a：笔刷与形状修复
rectangle "已完成：操作与布局\n大小滑条＋数字／窄窗口折叠\n矩形、椭圆、直线直接切换" as controls #254B3D
rectangle "已完成：功能与计算\nABR 静态笔尖／PNG 导入\n液化、涂抹轨迹索引／最终像素一致" as engine #254B3D
rectangle "已完成：验证\n962 项核心测试／十三组最终 EXE 检查\n3561 个界面断言／94 组双语弹窗" as verify #254B3D
rectangle "当前：0.6.4 交付\n原位置升级／公开源码和安装包\n独立 Windows 云端验证" as current #4A4230
rectangle "待完成\n完整 ABR 动态参数／其他计算瓶颈\n完整 Mac 功能和实机动画、DPI 对照" as pending #393B42
controls -down-> engine
